{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Weeks Till Winter",
    "steam_appid": 3262560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/9d43b87de5686fe31ea979f1cd45be8c.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weeks Till Winter is a strategy game about placing buildings on grid-like 3D terrain to maximize resource and population\u00a0gains. Resource management is minimalistic, but skilled play requires careful planning and deep game knowledge. With 7 different procedurally generated worlds, each playthrough offers a unique experience. Or play casually in free-build mode, without time or resource constraints, to make something interesting and beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/f13bd78b94c2a59ae23f7c0dc1ae8efe.poster.webp?t=1754302537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/f13bd78b94c2a59ae23f7c0dc1ae8efe.webp?t=1754302537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building placement spends a week, and the passing of weeks leads to the passing of seasons. Build placements can be undone and retried within a season to maximize gains. Importantly, some building arrangements trigger bonus structures, generating extra resources, and creating a multitude of possibilities for any given turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/47b2e8a4da064fcd93f16b05281acf55.poster.webp?t=1754302537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/47b2e8a4da064fcd93f16b05281acf55.webp?t=1754302537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your population grows, you can expand to new  terrain providing additional resources and space for more complex structures. You must take care, however, as ruins of a failed civilization lie scattered about. When winter comes, nearby altars stir, unleashing terrors upon your city which can only be\u00a0held back by heat and flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/04ab071652432fa04f910aa4a07c0a9f.poster.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/04ab071652432fa04f910aa4a07c0a9f.webm?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/04ab071652432fa04f910aa4a07c0a9f.mp4?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire special items to boost population gains, enhance resource production, or destroy altars and winter terrors. Any item can be used without spending any time, but such actions cannot be undone. Use these tools wisely to reach the highest levels of renown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/6ad70d1911ad6169313a2d3a9e3ed0df.poster.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/6ad70d1911ad6169313a2d3a9e3ed0df.webm?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/6ad70d1911ad6169313a2d3a9e3ed0df.mp4?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes nearly 20 challenge maps in addition to the randomized worlds, and also provides the level editor used to create those challenge maps. Unleash your imagination to create your own custom worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/364f8df45a5f68952e72da3ac40315a3.poster.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/364f8df45a5f68952e72da3ac40315a3.webm?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/364f8df45a5f68952e72da3ac40315a3.mp4?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will discover fragmentary manuscripts from the failed civilization that preceded you. Through voice-acted journal entries, fables, and historical records, you can piece together the forgotten lore that explains this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/8906b5f126fdd50496795c9dd81af096.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weeks Till Winter offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different worlds of procedurally generated terrain for standard play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-build mode without the constraints of resource costs nor winter terrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 puzzle-like challenge maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor to build your own playable worlds or custom scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lore-based fragmented narrative, with more than a dozen hidden manuscripts to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and windmills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/5870ae4882d5b49d2ecf679b22cc4df2.poster.webp?t=1754302537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/5870ae4882d5b49d2ecf679b22cc4df2.webp?t=1754302537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=432 height=347 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/9d43b87de5686fe31ea979f1cd45be8c.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weeks Till Winter is a strategy game about placing buildings on grid-like 3D terrain to maximize resource and population\u00a0gains. Resource management is minimalistic, but skilled play requires careful planning and deep game knowledge. With 7 different procedurally generated worlds, each playthrough offers a unique experience. Or play casually in free-build mode, without time or resource constraints, to make something interesting and beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/f13bd78b94c2a59ae23f7c0dc1ae8efe.poster.webp?t=1754302537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/f13bd78b94c2a59ae23f7c0dc1ae8efe.webp?t=1754302537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building placement spends a week, and the passing of weeks leads to the passing of seasons. Build placements can be undone and retried within a season to maximize gains. Importantly, some building arrangements trigger bonus structures, generating extra resources, and creating a multitude of possibilities for any given turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/47b2e8a4da064fcd93f16b05281acf55.poster.webp?t=1754302537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/47b2e8a4da064fcd93f16b05281acf55.webp?t=1754302537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your population grows, you can expand to new  terrain providing additional resources and space for more complex structures. You must take care, however, as ruins of a failed civilization lie scattered about. When winter comes, nearby altars stir, unleashing terrors upon your city which can only be\u00a0held back by heat and flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/04ab071652432fa04f910aa4a07c0a9f.poster.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/04ab071652432fa04f910aa4a07c0a9f.webm?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/04ab071652432fa04f910aa4a07c0a9f.mp4?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire special items to boost population gains, enhance resource production, or destroy altars and winter terrors. Any item can be used without spending any time, but such actions cannot be undone. Use these tools wisely to reach the highest levels of renown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/6ad70d1911ad6169313a2d3a9e3ed0df.poster.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/6ad70d1911ad6169313a2d3a9e3ed0df.webm?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/6ad70d1911ad6169313a2d3a9e3ed0df.mp4?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes nearly 20 challenge maps in addition to the randomized worlds, and also provides the level editor used to create those challenge maps. Unleash your imagination to create your own custom worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/364f8df45a5f68952e72da3ac40315a3.poster.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/364f8df45a5f68952e72da3ac40315a3.webm?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/364f8df45a5f68952e72da3ac40315a3.mp4?t=1754302537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will discover fragmentary manuscripts from the failed civilization that preceded you. Through voice-acted journal entries, fables, and historical records, you can piece together the forgotten lore that explains this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/8906b5f126fdd50496795c9dd81af096.avif?t=1754302537\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weeks Till Winter offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different worlds of procedurally generated terrain for standard play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-build mode without the constraints of resource costs nor winter terrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 puzzle-like challenge maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor to build your own playable worlds or custom scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lore-based fragmented narrative, with more than a dozen hidden manuscripts to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and windmills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/5870ae4882d5b49d2ecf679b22cc4df2.poster.webp?t=1754302537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262560/extras/5870ae4882d5b49d2ecf679b22cc4df2.webp?t=1754302537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=432 height=347 /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In a dark study with a Book of Worlds and a handful of wooden buildings, you are cursed to build until you've unlocked the secrets of your mysterious past. This is a score-based strategy game using city-builder mechanics.",
